{"ref":"BDB, גֹּ֫בַהּ","hw":"גֹּ֫בַהּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּ֫בַהּ</span></big>  <strong>n.m. height</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Job 22:12\" href=\"/Job.22.12\">Jb 22:12</a> + 9 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבְהוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.4\">1 S 17:4</a> + 5 times; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבְהֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:8\" href=\"/Job.11.8\">Jb 11:8</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>height</em>, of buildings and trees <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.18\">Ez 1:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.11\">19:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.10\">31:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:42\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.42\">40:42</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.8\">41:8</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.4\">2 Ch 3:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:9\" href=\"/Amos.2.9\">Am 2:9</a>; prob. also <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.13\">Ez 43:13</a> (of altar), so 𝔊 Ew Co for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּב</span> (q.v.); of man <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.4\">1 S 17:4</a>; heaven <a data-ref=\"Job 11:8\" href=\"/Job.11.8\">Jb 11:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 22:12\" href=\"/Job.22.12\">22:12</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">גבה</span> cstr. SI<sup>6</sup> of rock).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>exaltation, grandeur</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:10\" href=\"/Job.40.10\">Jb 40:10</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>haughtiness</em>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.29\">Je 48:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גּ׳ אַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:4\" href=\"/Psalms.10.4\">ψ 10:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גּ׳־לִבּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:26\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.26\">2 Ch 32:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גּ׳ רוּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.18\">Pr 16:18</a>.","next":"BDB, גַּבְהוּת","prev":"BDB, גָּבֹהַּ"}